{"study_accession":"PRJNA1075110","secondary_study_accession":"SRP489172","title":"Functional and mechanistic study of the inhibitory role of the antisense long non-coding RNA (IRF1-AS1) in regulating the transcriptional activity of IRF1 and M1 polarization of macrophages in ARDS.","description":"Through high-throughput sequencing and further cell and animal experiments, we found that the antisense long non-coding RNA of IRF1 (IRF1-AS1) binds to the intronic region of IRF1, inhibiting its transcriptional activity and thereby regulating macrophage activation and inflammation-induced lung injury in ARDS. Overall design: CD14 cells were obtained from our hospital's biobank. After 48 hours of in vitro colony-stimulating factor induction, total RNA and DNA were extracted from cells treated with LPS and IFNγ for 24 hours. ChIP-seq/ATAC-seq and RNA-seq were performed using specific antibodies and assay kits.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":9,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN39905502","study_accession":"PRJNA1075110","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"IFN-M1C1 IFN-M1C2","description":"IFN-M1C1 IFN-M1C2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8073291","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":2,"first_public":"2025-09-21","attributes":[["source_name","Peripheral blood monocyte"],["cell_type","Peripheral blood monocyte"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR27931369","experiment_accession":"SRX23588411","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":55448838,"base_count":5600332638,"first_public":"2025-09-21","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM8073291: IFN-M1C1 IFN-M1C2 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR27931370","experiment_accession":"SRX23588411","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":55448838,"base_count":5600332638,"first_public":"2025-09-21","experi